    """Absolute-row range of price variable var from the first to the last block in column col; INDEX it with the
    block position (Inputs_prices column pos, looked up in the D:G columns of the rows that use it)."""
    return f'{col}${prow(var, PRICES[0][0])}:{col}${prow(var, PRICES[-1][0])}'
